worked_examples.solution:
The error is treating the Big Bang like an ordinary explosion at one special place, sending galaxies out into pre-existing empty space.

The corrected description: the whole Universe, space included, expanded from a single point of extremely high density and temperature, and space itself has been stretching ever since, carrying galaxies apart;

there is no centre in today's space that the galaxies are moving away from.
